 * <ul>
 * <li>'<code>/docs/cvs/commit.html</code>' and '<code>/docs/cvs/commit.html</code> -> ''</li>
 * <li>'<code>/docs/*</code>' and '<code>/docs/cvs/commit</code> -> '<code>cvs/commit</code>'</li>
