                                + "BenchmarkTest02557"
                                + "' in query string.");
        return;
    }
    String param =
            queryString.substring(
                    paramLoc
                            + paramval
                                    .length()); // 1st assume "BenchmarkTest02557" param is last
    // parameter in query string.
